      "writtenOn": "2020-08-21T19:10:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had an idea for synchronization since our API for discovery is sooo open (not const and sharing a buffer to anyone that wants it!!!)\n\n\nin pd_get_am_discovery\n\nadd\n\natmoic_or(\u0026task_access, BIT(task_get_current_id());\n\n\nand then add\n\npd_discovery_access_clear() {\n   atomic_clear(\u0026task_access);\n}\n\nand then here at the end of the function, validate that \n\nbool pd_discovery_access_validate(int port) {\n   atmoic_or(\u0026task_access, BIT(task_get_current_id()); // for compiler fence\n   return task_access \u0026 ~BIT(task_get_current());\n}\n\n\n--\n\nIf we don\u0027t validate then set response size to 0 and return a BUSY error code (or something else that makes sense)",
      "range": {
